                <pb facs="0284" n="266" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p1/pg266"/>

                <head>United States relations with Australia</head>
                <p>[For documentation concerning negotiations between the United States and
                    Australia antecedent to the signing of the Security Treaty between Australia,
                    New Zealand, and the United States, see <ref target="#pg132">pages 132</ref> ff.
                    For documentation regarding consultations between Australia and the United
                    States concerning a Japanese Peace Treaty, see <ref target="#pg777">pages
                        777</ref> ff. For documentation concerning talks between the two countries
                    with regard to the status of Netherlands New Guinea, see <ref target="#pg583"
                        >pages 583</ref> ff. Documentation on the Australian attitude toward issues
                    of common concern in the Middle East is scheduled for publication in volume
                    V.]</p>
            </div>
